WEBVTT

00:15.948 --> 00:18.948
This is the chaotic time of
spontaneous gangs.

00:19.657 --> 00:20.823
In order to scramble for territory...

00:21.612 --> 00:23.236
they are not afraid
to purge each other...

00:23.237 --> 00:24.237
despite the rules.

00:26.571 --> 00:27.071
Butcher...

00:28.529 --> 00:29.029
slaughter...

00:30.862 --> 00:31.946
to survive.

00:33.904 --> 00:35.612
Until the formation of four forces.

00:38.196 --> 00:40.487
These four hold hundreds of juniors
under their command...

00:40.696 --> 00:42.987
creating a balance in the underworld
during the time.

00:45.029 --> 00:46.821
They are known as:

00:47.487 --> 00:47.946
Cuong...

00:49.154 --> 00:50.404
Area: Cho Lon - Weapon: Chopper
Business: Protection, loaning.

00:50.446 --> 00:51.154
Hao...

00:51.179 --> 00:53.987
Area: Float Market - Weapon: Scimitar
Business: Protection, smuggling.

00:54.279 --> 00:54.779
Chan...

00:54.804 --> 00:57.154
Area: Cau Muoi Market - Weapon: Ice saw
Business: Protection, restaurants.

00:57.237 --> 00:57.803
Hung.

00:57.828 --> 00:59.904
Area: Night Market - Weapon: Pig chopper
knife Business: Smuggling, prostitute.

01:16.412 --> 01:16.912
Long!

01:17.829 --> 01:18.329
Long!

01:20.579 --> 01:21.079
Long!

01:21.537 --> 01:22.662
I'm fine.

01:23.287 --> 01:24.162
Big Brother is in trouble.

01:25.079 --> 01:26.028
Call Hung.

01:54.370 --> 01:55.620
Phong!

02:01.495 --> 02:03.370
Kill him!

02:23.120 --> 02:23.870
What the hell?

02:29.037 --> 02:29.495
Boss!

02:32.912 --> 02:33.579
We gotta run!

02:50.620 --> 02:52.204
Have you lost your mind?

02:54.287 --> 02:56.787
Why did you come here, asshole?

03:00.204 --> 03:01.620
You bastard!

03:16.662 --> 03:19.745
Big Brother! Run!

03:26.579 --> 03:26.995
Dad!

03:40.954 --> 03:41.579
Run for your life!

03:53.037 --> 03:53.537
Run!

03:54.641 --> 03:55.057
Dad!

04:38.162 --> 04:38.870
Are you all right?

04:43.954 --> 04:44.329
Hanh!

04:46.579 --> 04:47.079
Hung?

04:48.412 --> 04:49.579
Get my father out of here first.

04:52.037 --> 04:52.537
Let's go, Big Brother.

04:58.329 --> 04:58.813
Cop!

05:00.037 --> 05:01.662
It's time for you to pay me.

05:04.953 --> 05:06.482
Did you really have to do that?

05:16.579 --> 05:19.662
CARDS ON THE TABLE

05:19.687 --> 05:21.145
What is punch-drunk syndrome?

05:23.162 --> 05:24.620
It's a form of brain injury.

05:26.079 --> 05:28.321
Mild symptoms could include hearing loss...

05:28.537 --> 05:29.399
and vision loss.

05:30.454 --> 05:31.735
The severe condition could lead to…

05:34.245 --> 05:35.243
How about Phong?

05:37.245 --> 05:38.620
He's still in a coma...

05:39.745 --> 05:41.454
but he's out of danger.

05:45.829 --> 05:46.704
Fighting and killing...

05:47.412 --> 05:48.287
whether you win or lose...

05:49.120 --> 05:50.287
bring loss.

05:52.537 --> 05:53.412
Why...

05:54.870 --> 05:56.995
are the choices of people I care...

05:58.620 --> 05:59.745
about never include me?

06:25.412 --> 06:27.079
How did things come to this?

06:33.787 --> 06:35.079
You still have your brothers.

06:37.662 --> 06:38.370
But...

06:39.120 --> 06:40.870
I only have you now.

07:07.579 --> 07:08.620
I'm sorry.

07:13.412 --> 07:15.287
I couldn't keep our child.

07:21.870 --> 07:22.745
I'm sorry.

07:55.537 --> 07:56.162
Drugs.

07:56.745 --> 07:57.370
Night Market.

07:58.662 --> 08:00.370
Hac Hung and even Phong.

08:03.204 --> 08:04.620
It was all Chan's plan.

08:09.037 --> 08:10.745
Had I been more thoughtful at that time...

08:11.995 --> 08:13.537
Phong wouldn't have been like this.

08:16.995 --> 08:18.537
Did Dung tell you anything else?

08:19.579 --> 08:20.829
That was all she could hear.

08:28.870 --> 08:29.662
Who is Cop?

08:38.870 --> 08:40.870
Seems like Chan
wants to swallow up Cho Lon.

08:41.912 --> 08:43.787
You should quit after this.

08:47.620 --> 08:48.620
There's one more thing.

09:23.912 --> 09:24.662
Ba's calling.

09:26.204 --> 09:27.912
Tell him to stay there,
don't go back to the city yet.

09:33.370 --> 09:34.620
Long's father is on the way to Saigon.

09:34.829 --> 09:35.954
You guys wait for me at the hospital.

09:45.245 --> 09:45.870
Fighting him!

09:52.079 --> 09:52.704
Fuck!

10:11.620 --> 10:12.037
Dad!

10:14.245 --> 10:14.662
Dad!

10:15.370 --> 10:15.662
Dad!

10:15.663 --> 10:17.329
Your father's condition has gotten worse…

10:17.579 --> 10:19.245
he needs emergency surgery.

10:19.579 --> 10:20.662
Dad, it's me, Long…

10:20.704 --> 10:21.787
Please hold on, dad…

10:22.579 --> 10:22.995
Dad!

10:24.370 --> 10:26.204
My goodness…what happened to your face?

10:26.662 --> 10:27.495
I'll explain later.

10:29.954 --> 10:30.287
Dad!

10:37.704 --> 10:38.495
What happened to you?

10:39.579 --> 10:40.245
I'm okay.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.120
Some bastards blocked my way.

11:39.495 --> 11:40.037
Mom!

11:42.704 --> 11:43.662
How…how is my dad, doctor?

12:13.579 --> 12:16.245
Why didn't you focus on studying?

12:16.704 --> 12:17.704
You're always watching those stupid movies!

12:18.329 --> 12:20.244
- I'm not! Dad!
- You learned martial arts for what?

12:20.245 --> 12:21.870
You're never studying!

13:33.162 --> 13:33.870
Go check on him.

14:19.745 --> 14:20.704
As you know...

14:20.870 --> 14:23.204
they played dirty
with Big Brother over and over.

14:24.870 --> 14:27.204
We can't keep standing by to watch.

14:27.829 --> 14:29.870
We must show them who we are.

14:32.954 --> 14:33.370
Lu!

14:38.370 --> 14:39.912
Who released these bastards?

14:40.995 --> 14:42.411
Cho Lon is the fortune that Big Brother...

14:42.412 --> 14:44.037
has built over the past 20 years.

14:45.579 --> 14:47.704
Why are you taking such a reckless gamble?

14:53.037 --> 14:57.204
A traitor like you is not
qualified to say that to me.

14:59.204 --> 14:59.954
Traitor?

15:01.537 --> 15:02.454
There's something...

15:03.620 --> 15:05.162
I have to clarify.

15:13.745 --> 15:14.162
First...

15:15.162 --> 15:18.412
I indeed cooperated with Chan.

15:22.829 --> 15:23.370
Second...

15:24.787 --> 15:27.537
it is true that I met Hien.

15:29.829 --> 15:30.912
But do you know why?

15:31.454 --> 15:33.704
Because he returned my dumb-ass son to me.

15:51.162 --> 15:52.204
Release this one.

15:55.995 --> 15:57.037
And the last thing...

15:58.120 --> 16:00.162
Chan sold drugs inside schools...

16:02.912 --> 16:04.162
I didn't know this.

16:05.120 --> 16:07.037
And that violated
my ultimate forbidden rule.

16:07.662 --> 16:10.912
This wasn't in our contract.

16:12.287 --> 16:13.745
Therefore this war...

16:15.870 --> 16:16.912
I will not participate.

16:19.954 --> 16:20.870
I came here...

16:22.162 --> 16:24.120
to clear his name.

16:25.120 --> 16:27.995
For me, brothers are above all.

16:30.579 --> 16:33.912
You guys will handle your own problem.

16:34.954 --> 16:37.412
And I'll handle my family's problem.

16:39.579 --> 16:40.204
Let's go home.

16:47.829 --> 16:49.037
One party has withdrawn...

16:50.620 --> 16:52.245
the balance is back.

17:02.120 --> 17:03.037
You don't seem happy.

17:15.370 --> 17:16.954
Yeah, I got it.

17:17.245 --> 17:17.745
I guard him...

17:17.746 --> 17:19.037
even more carefully
than babysitting my own child.

17:20.287 --> 17:20.787
Okay.

17:28.162 --> 17:28.912
Long!

17:28.954 --> 17:29.912
Holy moly!

17:30.537 --> 17:32.120
Ouch!

17:34.662 --> 17:35.495
Long!

17:36.537 --> 17:37.954
Are you nuts? What the hell are you doing?

17:41.579 --> 17:43.204
Keep…going…

17:44.954 --> 17:46.412
Have you checked on Phong?

17:46.912 --> 17:48.162
You only do crazy things all the time.

17:48.620 --> 17:49.495
Yes, I have.

17:50.329 --> 17:51.329
Take care of yourself first.

17:51.412 --> 17:52.287
He won't die easily.

18:28.745 --> 18:30.329
That coward Hao is off the table!

18:34.120 --> 18:35.162
Are you guys ready?

18:48.662 --> 18:49.287
Go!

18:56.954 --> 18:58.037
You have a phone call, Long!

19:01.829 --> 19:03.037
Long, your phone's ringing!

19:08.454 --> 19:09.287
Long?

19:11.537 --> 19:12.370
Long!

19:16.495 --> 19:18.120
Long!

19:22.037 --> 19:23.662
Holy moly!

19:25.162 --> 19:26.162
Holy moly!

19:27.745 --> 19:28.870
You're insane!

20:32.245 --> 20:34.079
I'll give you one last chance.

20:35.995 --> 20:38.037
Leave Cho Lon
to follow me and you will live.

20:41.579 --> 20:42.120
Otherwise...

20:44.745 --> 20:45.537
you will die.

20:47.454 --> 20:49.745
You want me to join you?

20:51.287 --> 20:53.204
Get the fuck off, you son of a bitch.

21:22.829 --> 21:23.454
Go on!

22:57.870 --> 22:58.829
Why do you come here?

23:57.704 --> 23:58.662
Long! Have you lost your mind?

24:00.912 --> 24:01.912
You're gonna kill him!

24:25.495 --> 24:27.245
Stop!

24:31.370 --> 24:33.204
Stop!

24:33.995 --> 24:34.495
Stop!

24:35.162 --> 24:35.870
Stop!

24:41.245 --> 24:41.829
Fine!

24:42.454 --> 24:44.120
You won today.

24:44.579 --> 24:45.829
Cho Lon will…

24:46.120 --> 24:47.370
Will never lose!

24:54.995 --> 24:55.495
Big Brother!

24:56.704 --> 24:58.662
I don't dare accept
those two words from you.

25:00.412 --> 25:01.412
It was such a waste...

25:02.829 --> 25:04.537
of using my flesh to save you...

25:05.870 --> 25:07.412
from being stabbed last time.

25:19.662 --> 25:20.537
Big Brother!

25:21.745 --> 25:22.829
By any standards...

25:23.454 --> 25:26.454
everything I do, I do it for Cho Lon.

25:27.704 --> 25:29.120
I want you to prosper.

25:29.245 --> 25:31.620
I want every brother here
to have more money.

25:32.079 --> 25:33.079
Why are you being so uptight?

25:34.329 --> 25:34.829
Lu!

25:36.037 --> 25:38.704
Gangsters must still
rely on society to survive.

25:39.495 --> 25:40.995
You'll never be able to live long...

25:41.787 --> 25:42.829
with that type of income.

25:46.454 --> 25:48.079
I am sick of you!

25:48.912 --> 25:50.370
Hey, Big Brother!

25:50.954 --> 25:52.162
Don't you hear people say?

25:52.620 --> 25:54.245
A wise man changes his mind, a fool…

25:54.370 --> 25:55.245
Is you, Lu!

25:55.537 --> 25:56.037
Yes!

25:56.537 --> 25:58.495
It's me! So what?

26:03.704 --> 26:05.704
A traitor will always be
a traitor sooner or later.

27:32.329 --> 27:32.579
Long!

27:32.870 --> 27:33.329
Ba!

27:33.995 --> 27:34.662
Take care him!

27:35.495 --> 27:36.162
Hung, where are you going?

30:26.287 --> 30:27.120
Hung!

30:56.954 --> 30:58.495
Hung!

31:06.495 --> 31:07.704
Hung!

32:09.704 --> 32:11.329
Can you protect
hundreds of brothers in our gang?

32:36.495 --> 32:36.995
Spit it out!

32:36.996 --> 32:38.036
Holy crap, you'll be doggone!

32:38.037 --> 32:38.954
Spit it out!

32:39.620 --> 32:40.287
Damn it, spit it out!

32:40.995 --> 32:43.704
How dare you
touch my best friend's girlfriend?

32:45.412 --> 32:46.329
Brothers for life!

32:47.120 --> 32:48.495
We live and die together!

32:50.245 --> 32:52.037
Cheers!

32:57.495 --> 33:02.495
99 LATERS DAY

33:46.412 --> 33:48.079
Phong, come here and help me!

33:49.662 --> 33:50.162
Okay!

34:01.821 --> 34:03.279
Ut Det! I'm home!

34:04.037 --> 34:05.037
What took you so long?

34:05.745 --> 34:07.579
I bought some offerings
for Hung's 100-day funeral ceremony.

34:08.704 --> 34:10.120
Phong, come give me a hand!

34:14.745 --> 34:15.079
I'm here!

34:17.745 --> 34:18.454
Ut Det!

34:37.620 --> 34:38.787
It's dangerous to walk around
during pregnancy.

34:38.829 --> 34:39.745
Let me carry you!

34:40.162 --> 34:41.495
You silly!

34:43.745 --> 34:45.620
Holy moly…

34:53.704 --> 34:54.276
Long!

34:55.162 --> 34:55.877
Yes?

34:57.204 --> 34:58.120
Can we cook this now?

34:58.662 --> 34:59.454
Ok!

35:00.079 --> 35:01.409
You're insane!

35:40.370 --> 35:40.787
Ba!

35:42.579 --> 35:44.370
Have you ever done this with Ut Det?

35:45.204 --> 35:47.579
I haven't.
I save it for our wedding night.

35:47.995 --> 35:48.912
Be quiet…

35:50.037 --> 35:50.787
or my dad would hear…

36:02.954 --> 36:04.912
Jeez, it's Long! I thought that was my dad.

36:05.120 --> 36:05.745
You scared the hell out of me!

36:06.120 --> 36:06.829
What are you doing in here...

36:06.829 --> 36:07.662
that you're so scared of
your dad finding out?

36:10.954 --> 36:11.329
Sex...

36:12.245 --> 36:12.912
sex movie.

36:14.329 --> 36:15.162
But didn't you tell me...

36:15.163 --> 36:16.576
to come over
to watch Bruce Lee's movies?

36:17.370 --> 36:18.620
You're keeping it.

36:18.787 --> 36:19.444
Yeah…

36:21.454 --> 36:22.537
[THE BIG BOSS - BRUCE LEE]

37:12.829 --> 37:13.579
What happened?

37:15.245 --> 37:16.537
Some bastards came over…

37:17.287 --> 37:18.579
They took all the money.

37:18.959 --> 37:20.245
I don't know who they are.

37:23.037 --> 37:23.975
Is Ut Det okay?

37:24.537 --> 37:25.186
She's fine.

37:34.120 --> 37:34.620
Big Brother?

37:35.079 --> 37:35.823
A Hien?

37:36.495 --> 37:37.245
Big Brother? A Hien?

37:37.662 --> 37:38.972
They were the Night Market.

37:40.579 --> 37:41.729
Here, I give you some.

37:42.829 --> 37:43.440
Thank you.

37:44.662 --> 37:46.042
Chan had escaped.

37:46.954 --> 37:48.620
Hac Hung is planning something.

37:51.037 --> 37:53.018
Don't let Hung's death become meaningless.

39:00.954 --> 39:01.768
I heard it.

39:07.329 --> 39:07.917
Roger that!
